{"The sed -i '' command is macOS/BSD specific and will fail on Linux distributions - should use a portable method like temporary file approach": 0.8804129362106323, "SelectedCalendar.updatedAt is updated via updateManyByCredentialId but not used in the frontend, resulting in unnecessary database write operations on every cache refresh": 0.6145769953727722, "The date and time format for cacheUpdatedAt is hardcoded to 'en-US' locale instead of using the current user's locale from useLocale hook for consistent internationalization": 0.7676008939743042, "Throwing a generic Error instead of TRPCError results in misleading 500 Internal Server Error on client side - should use TRPCError with specific status codes like NOT_FOUND or FORBIDDEN": 0.8705198764801025}